[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z] docker-sandbox is a Docker CLI plugin
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z] 
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z] Management Commands:
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]   sandbox                    Docker Sandbox
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z] 
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z] Global Options:
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]       --config string      Location of client config files (default
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]                            "C:\\Users\\A\\.docker")
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]   -c, --context string     Name of the context to use to connect to the
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]                            daemon (overrides DOCKER_HOST env var and
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]                            default context set with "docker context use")
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]   -D, --debug              Enable debug mode
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]   -H, --host string        Daemon socket to connect to
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943003700Z]   -l, --log-level string   Set the logging level ("debug", "info",
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]                            "warn", "error", "fatal") (default "info")
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]       --tls                Use TLS; implied by --tlsverify
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]       --tlscacert string   Trust certs signed only by this CA (default
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]                            "C:\\Users\\A\\.docker\\ca.pem")
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]       --tlscert string     Path to TLS certificate file (default
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]                            "C:\\Users\\A\\.docker\\cert.pem")
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]       --tlskey string      Path to TLS key file (default
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]                            "C:\\Users\\A\\.docker\\key.pem")
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.943548200Z]       --tlsverify          Use TLS and verify the remote
[2026-07-17T03:49:11.944087700Z] 
